 &lt;div class="comment" title="Comment: tangential aside"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;WebContents&lt;/code&gt;, Chromium&amp;rsquo;s class that &amp;ldquo;renders web content (usually HTML) in a
rectangular area&amp;rdquo;, contains 200+ pure virtual methods! &lt;span class="citation-ref"&gt;&lt;a href="#ChromiumWebContents"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>